Question: In triangle $CAT$, we have $\angle{ACT}=\angle{ATC}$ and $\angle{CAT}=36^\circ$. If $\overline{TR}$ bisects $\angle{ATC}$, then how many degrees is $\angle{CRT}$? [asy]
/* AMC8 2000 #13 Problem */
draw((0,0)--(.5,1.75)--(1,0)--cycle);
draw((1,0)--(.15,.5));
